+## 4. Trigger Table
+
+Use this before starting any task. Read the indicated spec BEFORE touching files.
+
+| Task | Read first | Key gotchas |
+|------|-----------|-------------|
+| Add or rename a command | `src/core/command-catalog.ts` (scan existing IDs first) | Must add handler in `getAppMenuActions()`, set `api:true, agent:true` if needed, add to LEGACY_COMMAND_ALIASES if renaming |
+| Add a new window type | `.agents/architecture.md` §"Adding a New Window Type" | 10-step checklist — every item mandatory; wire into command catalog too |
+| Touch window-manager.ts | `src/core/types.ts` (WindowRecord), `src/core/window-chrome.ts` | Do not re-enable shadow; do not add size math inline |
+| Touch workspace save/restore | `src/core/snapshot-registry.ts`, `src/core/workspace-snapshots.ts` | Serialize params not paths; appType required for snapshot guard |
+| Touch theme system | `src/core/theme/types.ts` (ThemeTokens), `src/core/theme/resolver.ts` | All 23 tokens required; call `applyTheme()` after any `setThemeVariant()` |
+| Add a new module | `src/services/microapp-loader.ts`, `microapps/example-primers/` | microapp.json required; modules-private is a submodule — separate commit |
+| Edit microapps-private/ | Nothing to read — just remember: submodule commit first | NEVER `git add microapps-private/` in parent repo |
+| Touch control API | `.agents/control-api.md` | Check existing endpoints before adding; `describeState()` and API should evolve together |
+| Touch agent session | `src/services/wibwob-agent-session.ts` (read fully) | Multi-turn transcript lifecycle is subtle — re-read the event order comments |
+| Work on planning docs | `.pi/skills/planning-update/SKILL.md`, `.pi/skills/simplify-planning/SKILL.md` | Checkbox format `[x]/[~]/[ ]/[-]`, frontmatter status values, never duplicate in GitHub issues |
+| VJ timeline / music video | `.pi/skills/vj-timeline/SKILL.md` | Timeline JSON format, cue types, audio sync |
+| Chiptune / audio | `.pi/skills/chiptune/SKILL.md` | numpy bricks, pydub pipeline, WAV export path |
+| Backrooms / primers | `.pi/skills/backroom-log-explorer/SKILL.md` | Session log format, extraction patterns |
+| Micropolis / WibWobCity | `.pi/skills/micropolis-engine/SKILL.md` | Tile system, bitmasks, emscripten shim |
+| ASCII art sourcing | `.pi/skills/img-to-ascii/SKILL.md`, `.pi/skills/joan-stark-ascii-art/SKILL.md` | Conversion params, primer format |
+| Build/test/restart ops | `.pi/skills/ww-ops/SKILL.md` | tmux session name, health check, restart pattern |
+| Scaffold a new view | `.pi/skills/ww-scaffold-view/SKILL.md` | Full lifecycle from header to menu wiring |
+| Code review / cleanup | `.pi/skills/simplify/SKILL.md` | Three-pass: reuse, quality, efficiency |
+
+**If no trigger matches:** list `.pi/skills/` and pick the nearest specialist.
+Describe the task in one sentence and grep skill descriptions for keywords.
